<title>USA: Hospitality Worldwide units win $16 mln contracts.</title>
<headline>Hospitality Worldwide units win $16 mln contracts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospitality Worldwide Services Inc said Thursday that two units have received separate contracts valued at more than $16 million, to provide renovation, capital improvement and purchasing services at 11 hotels in the U.S. and South Africa.</p>
<p>The new projects are scheduled for completion during 1997, said the company, and are for properties which have not been clients in the past.</p>
</text>
